	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. D.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Scripsi tuae humanitati superioribus diebus et quidem <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>Germanice, quae hic dicantur et habeantur de <persName ref="p8112">rege <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>Galliarum</persName> <persName ref="p8112">Heinrycho</persName>.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Nunc illis haec subiicio, quod <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>superioribus diebus ex certis accepimus nunciis regem <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>ex vulnere illo mortem obiisse suam idque iulii <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>10. <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>die... filium ei successurum in regno; <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>dominum oro [ut] luctuosa patris morte e[um] reddat <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>prudentiorem, ne aures praebeat sanguinariis illis <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>carnalibus et aposcopis pergatque ecclesiam, <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>sponsam Christi, <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>persequi, unde et ipse et infoelix et maledictus pereat.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z14"/>Nullus enim a condito mundo impune ecclesiam Christi <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>persequtus est; est illa lapis ille oneris, de quo v<lb xml:id="p1z16"/>aticinatur Zaccarias, quem nemo unquam contrectavit, <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>ut non fuerit laesus ab illo.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><foreign xml:lang="de">Aber alles des leydts <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>und lydens sind eigentliche ursä[cher <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>d...] <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>geistlich huff gott vergällt [inen]</foreign> <lb xml:id="p1z23"/><placeName ref="l18">Augustae Vindelicorum</placeName> aposc... <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>ut se christianis, evangelio et pr..<lb xml:id="p1z25"/>. cipibus... rs cum Caesare.<lb xml:id="p1z26"/>.<lb xml:id="p1z27"/>. <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>est de celeb... <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>Principib... nibus refragantur.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Dominus deus <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>noster coherceat indomitos suos hostes, ut sponte <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>obediant verbo suo aut non noceant verbo suo, sed <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>sibi ipsis!</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Qui hasce tibi offert literas minister <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>est <persName ref="p20165">Heinrychi Gessneri</persName>, mercatoris et civis nostri, <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>viri optimi; est is sobrinus clarissimi viri d. d. <lb xml:id="p1z37"/><persName ref="p1283">Conradi Gessneri</persName> nostri.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Debitor ipsi est apud vos <lb xml:id="p1z38"/><persName>Sebastianus Drichschinawet</persName>, quemadmodum ipse tibi <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>referre poterit.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Diu artibus solutionem debitam pro<lb xml:id="p1z40"/>traxit tergiversator; nunc cum audivit me aliqua <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>apud te esse in gratia, oravit ipsum causamque eius tibi <lb xml:id="p1z42"/>commendarem, id quod nunc facio obsecrans, ei adsis, ut <lb xml:id="p1z43"/>pecuniam suam consequatur, quem alioqui iuris observ<lb xml:id="p1z44"/>antissimum esse novi.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Fac, ut intelligat meam apud <lb xml:id="p1z45"/>te commendationem aliquid habuisse ponderis.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p1z46"/>Salutato d. <persName ref="p6831">Traversum</persName>, parentem tuum d. <persName ref="p8011">Rodolphum</persName>, filium <lb xml:id="p1z47"/>nostrum <persName ref="p477">Ioannem</persName>, concionatores <placeName ref="l93">Clevenses</placeName>, fratres et amicos.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell"><lb xml:id="p1z48"/>Optime vale.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName> 26. iulii anno domini 1559.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p1z49"/>Salutant te nostri omnes.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z50"/><persName ref="p495">Bullingerus</persName> tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Clariss<pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>imo viro d. <persName ref="p8432">Frid[erycho] a Salice</persName> <placeName>Rheto</placeName>, com[issa]r<lb xml:id="p2z2"/>io <placeName ref="l93">Clavennensi</placeName>, domino suo colendissimo [et] <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>fratri charissimo.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z4"/>[An] junckher <persName ref="p8432">Fridry[ch von] Salis</persName>, co[m<lb xml:id="p2z5"/>issarien] zuͦ <placeName ref="l93">Clä[ven]</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
